  {
   "section": "TeaserGrid",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "15.10.26"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Fairtrade news"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "From Casual Worker to Supervisor: Jacqueline Chepsergon’s 25-year journey in Kenya’s flower Industry"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Today is the International Day of Rural Women, and it’s a moment to celebrate the critical role and contributions of women in agriculture. This year, Fairtrade is shining a light on Jacqueline Chepsergon, a supervisor at certified flower farm Maji Mazuri Flowers in Kenya."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Read more"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "05.10.26"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Press releases"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Fairtrade raises Minimum Price for bananas amid soaring costs for farmers"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Fairtrade International has increased its Minimum Prices for bananas in direct response to a combination of external pressures negatively impacting producers, including geopolitical instability, climate change, and rising input and logistics costs."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Read more"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "01.10.26"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Fairtrade news"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "“Coffee is like raising a child,\" how Mrs. Rizkani nurtures her crops and her community"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "For Mrs. Rizkani tending a coffee farm is like raising a child, it requires love, patience, and an unwavering commitment to watch something grow."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Read more"
    }
   ],
