     "order": 0,
     "text": "Fairtrade Products"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "What if purchases could drive sustainable growth, support communities, and protect resources? From cocoa to sugar and coffee, there is a wide array Fairtrade products creating measurable impact."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more",
